{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00893","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 临高台 · 僧贯休","name":"鼓吹曲辞 临高台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉风吹远念，使我升高台。\n宁知数片云，不是旧山来。\n故人天一涯，久客殊未回。\n雁来不得书，空寄声哀哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}